rt a situation or risk of conflict of interest as well as any type of wrongdoing or fraud (i.e. whistleblowing), and if I do so, I should not be treated unfairly or be sanctioned;\nI understand that the contracting authority reserves the right to verify this information.","dataType":"boolean","status":"active","datePublished":"2022-10-27T12:41:57Z","expectedValue":true},{"id":"209d1485-ff00-4f66-b9b7-6092a0ab4aed","title":"I confirm that I will keep all matters entrusted to me confidential. I will not communicate outside the [project team/evaluation committee] any confidential information that is revealed to me or that I have discovered. I will not make any adverse use of information given to me.","dataType":"boolean","status":"active","datePublished":"2022-10-27T12:41:57Z","expectedValue":true}]}],"relatesTo":"award","classification":{"scheme":"ESPD-2.2.1","id":"CRITERION.EXCLUSION.CONFLICT_OF_INTEREST.PROCEDURE_PARTICIPATION"}}],"items":[{"id":"48cd6662-cf7e-4d20-812b-ff24e16764ce","description":"reabilitarea apeductului din s.Cosernita r.Criuleni","classification":{"scheme":"CPV","id":"50800000-3","description":"Diverse servicii de întreţinere şi de reparare"},"quantity":1587.000,"unit":{"name":"Metru liniar","id":"18"},"relatedLot":"73bb7cc5-4761-4d43-8d4c-4cb6c21673d1"}],"lots":[{"id":"73bb7cc5-4761-4d43-8d4c-4cb6c21673d1","title":"reabilitarea apeductului din s.Cosernita r.Criuleni","description":"reabilitarea apeductului din s.Cosernita r.Criuleni","status":"active","statusDetails":"awarded","value":{"amount":4598520.86,"currency":"MDL"},"contractPeriod":{"startDate":"2022-10-28T05:50:29Z","endDate":"2022-12-30T06:50:29Z"},"placeOfPerformance":{"address":{"streetAddress":"Primaria Cosernita","postalCode":"4818","addressDetails":{"country":{"scheme":"iso-alpha2","id":"MD","description":"MOLDOVA","uri":"http://reference.iatistandard.org"},"region":{"scheme":"CUATM","id":"3100000","description":"Criuleni","uri":"http://statistica.md"},"locality":{"scheme":"CUATM","id":"3115000","description":"s.Coşerniţa (r-l Criuleni)","uri":"http://statistica.md"}}},"description":"-"},"hasOptions":false,"hasRecurrence":false,"hasRenewal":false}],"lotGroups":[{"optionToCombine":false}],"tenderPeriod":{"startDate":"2022-10-17T11:30:00Z","endDate":"2022-10-26T11:30:00Z"},"enquiryPeriod":{"startDate":"2022-10-06T12:20:01Z","endDate":"2022-10-17T11:30:00Z"},"awardPeriod":{"startDate":"2022-10-27T12:41:57Z"},"auctionPeriod":{"startDate":"2022-10-27T12:00:00Z","endDate":"2022-10-27T12:41:00Z"},"hasEnquiries":true,"enquiries":[{"id":"b98d9fef-da6c-4750-ade0-3a6ec8319331","date":"2022-10-06T18:18:47Z","title":"Modificari necesare","description":"O procedura a fost suspendata si alta ciudata creata...deci 4 zile dintre care 2 zile de weekend pentru actualizare, 7 zile pentru depunere si inca cu licitatie electronica din data de 18.10.22 cu scaderea pretului. Voi va bateti joc? Faceti modificarile de rigoare ca sa nu raspundeti mult la clarificari aici...","answer":"Am modificat termenii","dateAnswered":"2022-10-07T05:53:05Z"},{"id":"b79f58f7-4bcb-4a40-b194-b1424cdc90ab","date":"2022-10-09T14:10:29Z","title":"licitatia electronica","description":"De ce optati pentru licitatie electronica in 3 runde cu scaderea pretului la lucrari?","answer":"pentru ca suma este mare si ca agentii economici sa reuseasca sa analizeze caietul de sarcini si sa tregateasca documentatia.","dateAnswered":"2022-10-10T06:42:45Z"},{"id":"086397be-8454-48a9-8518-45039ee2f35c","date":"2022-10-10T07:16:17Z","title":"Garantie pentru oferta","description":"Buna ziua, va rugam sa publicati rechizitele bancare \r\nin vederea perfectarii garantiei prin transfer la contul autoritatii contractante, \r\nmultumim anticipat.","answer":"RECHIZITELE PRIMARIEI Cosernita R.CRIULENI MD.s.Cosernita r-nul Criuleni Primaria Cosernita Codul fiscal -1007601009705 Banca - MF Trezoreria de Stat c/b TREZMD2X IBAN - MD36TRPCEC518410A01510AA Contabil-sef- fix-024879286 mobil: 069618650 e-mail-maria.str